sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor FE as Frontend / Postman
participant GW as Gateway :8099
participant AUTH as Auth Service :8091
participant ADB as Auth DB

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Main Dashboard
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/main-dashboard (Bearer)
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Load role_module_access by role + companyId
AUTH->>ADB: Load active modules
AUTH->>ADB: Load company_module_subscriptions
AUTH->>AUTH: Enforce subscriptions if present
AUTH-->>GW: modules[] with canView
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Module Dashboard
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/module-dashboard {moduleCode}
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Check role module access (company)
AUTH->>ADB: Check module subscription ACTIVE
alt not allowed or unsubscribed
    AUTH-->>GW: Success with empty data
else allowed
    AUTH->>ADB: Load sections and pages
    AUTH-->>GW: section/page data
end
GW-->>FE: Response
end
